uge ﬁeld” or “vector potential”.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nweek86 (https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/week86.html)\nciteturn410search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 30.2 years ago; Crawled: 18.8 years ago; 2) John Baez, Strings, loops, knots, and gauge fields, in \"Knots and Quantum Gravity\", ed. ... 4) Michael Reisenberger, Worldsheet formulations of gauge theories and Gravity, University of Utrecht preprint, 1994, available as gr-qc/9412035.\n"
